&lt;li&gt;Write clean, well-tested code, applying unit and integration testing practices as part of your day-to-day development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with relational databases (such as PostgreSQL, MySQL or SQL Server) and, where relevant, NoSQL stores (such as MongoDB or DynamoDB) using Spring Data JPA/Hibernate, writing efficient queries with support from the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in code reviews, both giving and receiving feedback, to build your understanding of engineering best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with senior engineers, tech leads and product colleagues to understand requirements and deliver well-defined pieces of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use CI/CD pipelines and Git-based workflows to ship changes safely, building your understanding of the wider software delivery lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
