&lt;p&gt;This is a client-facing role. You own a strategy or transformation workstream end to end, usually within a larger engagement led by a Lead or Principal. You shape the research, frame the problem, facilitate the sessions and build the recommendations, then help the client act on them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work with CreateFuture&#39;s complementary disciplines (Strategy, Design, Product, AI Engineering and Data) alongside the client&#39;s own teams, often embedded with them. You are accountable for the quality and commercial relevance of what your workstream delivers, not the volume of it.&lt;/p&gt;
