&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Design, build and maintain scalable, secure and resilient backend systems using Go, alongside rich, responsive frontends built with React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead technical design and architectural discussions, ensuring solutions are maintainable, performant and aligned with best practices across the stack.&lt;/li&gt;
