&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Champion engineering excellence through clean code, automated testing, documentation and code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive delivery across multiple initiatives while balancing speed, quality and commercial value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Mentor engineers through coaching, pairing and constructive feedback, helping raise capability across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to solve problems together and deliver outstanding outcomes for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
