&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll prove that story through public latency and quality benchmarks, inference economics and TCO, and competitive campaigns against hosted-inference and speech providers. Success is measured by inference consumption, dedicated GPU contract value, and pipeline attributed to compute launches and campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
