&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4919&quot; data-local-id=&quot;819dcc6d2bb4&quot;&gt;Experience with distillation, speculative decoding, EAGLE, Medusa, multi-token prediction, or other inference acceleration methods.&lt;/p&gt;
