&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5292&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f030cb084e2a&quot;&gt;Open-source contributions to vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, FlashInfer, LMCache, PyTorch, Triton, Ray, KServe, or related projects.&lt;/p&gt;
